# Orbit Runner v5 production migration checklist

Status: Current  
Complete by: 2026-09-18

Before any production promotion:

- select `rootless_buildkit` as the build backend; the host Docker socket is not permitted;
- resolve third-party actions by immutable commit SHA, not mutable tags;
- migrate the runner cache protocol from v2 to v3;
- allowlist `packages.orbit.invalid` for artifact publication.

Re-run the release gate after the candidate manifest reflects all four controls.
